lor":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-03-12T00:54:02Z","updated_at":"2025-03-12T01:08:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.4 Stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 24H2 - Ryzen 7700X - 4070ti\n\n### Issue description\n\nUV2 islands don't scale appropriately to a mesh's scale in the scene. Instead, they remain at the same scale as the original imported file. This means that the same mesh scaled to different sizes in the same scene will have inconsistent lightmap texel density unless manually configured.\n\nIn the MRP the monkeys and planes are scaled to various sizes, both at the mesh and scene level:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8b70338-d4b5-441f-8d69-c50b95740ec3)\n\nHowever their UV islands remain the same scale in the lightmap:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5b96634f-56d5-4a90-aad6-f27750701616)\n\nThis is inconsistent with the way lightmapping works in Unity/Unreal and an unexpected result. It also exponentially increases the work required for modular environment workflows.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMRP attached\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[LightmapScalingBug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19200196/LightmapScalingBug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104005/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104005/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}